WEBVTT

00:05:56.177 --> 00:06:01.666
(Nature sounds)

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:11.153
Coming up is the sound of a woodpecker.

00:06:11.177 --> 00:06:13.743
Well, I've returned
to Lincoln Meadow 15 times

00:06:13.767 --> 00:06:15.227
in the last 25 years,

00:06:15.251 --> 00:06:18.913
and I can tell you that the biophony,

00:06:18.937 --> 00:06:21.818
the density and diversity
of that biophony,

00:06:21.842 --> 00:06:24.370
has not yet returned
to anything like it was

00:06:24.394 --> 00:06:26.568
before the operation.

00:06:26.592 --> 00:06:29.666
But here's a picture
of Lincoln Meadow taken after,

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:32.904
and you can see
that from the perspective of the camera